<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"YEN\u0130 Parti Ayd\u0131n'da il\u00e7e il\u00e7e sonu\u00e7lar","articleSection":"Ayd\u0131n","dateCreated":"2026-10-18T20:13:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-18T20:13:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-22T12:53:34+03:00","wordCount":379,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.aydintimes.com\/yeni-parti-aydinda-ilce-ilce-sonuclar"},"articleBody":"Yeni Parti Ayd\u0131n \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131'n\u0131 belirleyecek \u00f6n se\u00e7im maratonu sona erdi. Sabah saatlerinde ba\u015flayan ve il genelindeki 17 il\u00e7ede kurulan sand\u0131klarda s\u00fcren oy verme i\u015flemlerinin ard\u0131ndan t\u00fcm sand\u0131klar a\u00e7\u0131larak kesin oy say\u0131lar\u0131 netle\u015fti.\r\n\r\nDilaver Demir 740 Oy Farkla Kazand\u0131\r\n\r\n\u0130l genelinde yap\u0131lan say\u0131m sonucunda Dilaver Demir 4 bin 152 oyla sand\u0131ktan birinci \u00e7\u0131karak partinin yeni il ba\u015fkan\u0131 se\u00e7ildi. Demir, en yak\u0131n rakibi olan ve 3 bin 412 oy alan Kemal G\u00fcneri\u2019yi 740 oy farkla geride b\u0131rakt\u0131. Yar\u0131\u015fta Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz 1.319 oy, Bayram \u0130nci 866 oy, \u0130smet Bozkurt ise 823 oy ald\u0131. Bu tablonun ard\u0131ndan Dilaver Demir, ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek \u0130l Kongresi\u2019nde delegelerin kar\u015f\u0131s\u0131na tek aday olarak \u00e7\u0131kacak.\r\n\r\n\u0130\u015fte \u0130l\u00e7e \u0130l\u00e7e Kesin Se\u00e7im Sonu\u00e7lar\u0131\r\n\r\nBozdo\u011fan\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 276\r\n \r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 76\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 21\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 11\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 5\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nBuharkent\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 36\r\n \r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 26\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 14\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 3\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 0\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\u00c7ine\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 552\r\n \r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 185\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 112\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 18\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 18\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nDidim\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 1.593\r\n \r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 521\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 102\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 28\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 23\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nEfeler\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 613\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 588\r\n \r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 373\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 345\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 230\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nGermencik\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 276\r\n \r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 146\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 23\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 13\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 6\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\u0130ncirliova\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 231\r\n \r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 120\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 17\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 15\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 3\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nKaracasu\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 66\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 23\r\n \r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 16\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 13\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 7\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nKarpuzlu\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 40\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 11\r\n \r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 9\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 6\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 4\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nKo\u00e7arl\u0131\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 163\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 33\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 19\r\n \r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 13\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 2\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nK\u00f6\u015fk\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 29\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal\u0131nomuz: 24\r\n \r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 10\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130smet Bozkurt: 7\r\n \r\n \r\n Bayram \u0130nci: 1\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nKu\u015fadas\u0131\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Kemal G\u00fcneri: 561\r\n \r\n \r\n Dilaver Demir: 494\r\n \r\n \r\n Barkan Kal